sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Family Member
    participant C as ChatGPT or /chat
    participant W as Serverless Next.js Control Plane
    participant A as Better Auth
    participant J as Jazz
    participant D as Home MCPDevice
    participant L as Desktop Commander stdio MCP

    F->>C: Open ChatGPT MCP app or /chat
    C->>W: Request on family.example.com
    W->>A: Validate browser session or OAuth token
    A-->>W: userId / subject
    W->>J: Check family membership + device grant
    J-->>W: Authorized shared laptop

    opt Start or refresh work window
        W->>J: Upsert agentSession lease (expires in ~25m)
        J-->>W: sessionId + expiresAt
    end

    C->>W: Submit message or MCP tool request
    W->>J: Create message + remoteCalls(pending)
    W-->>C: Accepted/job state or short synchronous wait

    J-->>D: Subscription delivers pending remoteCall
    D->>W: Claim call via device control API
    W->>J: pending -> executing
    J-->>W: claim durable
    W-->>D: claim accepted
    D->>L: MCP Client -> StdioClientTransport -> call tool
    L-->>D: Local tool result
    D->>W: Complete call via device control API
    W->>J: executing -> completed/failed
    W->>J: Update linked chat message/event

    par /chat live view
        J-->>C: Realtime sync / bounded polling update
        C-->>F: Render tool progress/result
    and ChatGPT MCP short call
        W-->>C: Return MCP result if within request budget
        C-->>F: ChatGPT continues response
    end

    alt Work exceeds serverless request budget
        W-->>C: Return jobId/sessionId
        F->>C: Continue later / UI keeps observing
        C->>W: get_task_status(jobId)
        W->>J: Read durable call/message state
        J-->>W: Current status/result
        W-->>C: Status/result
    end

    Note over W,J: No 25-minute HTTP request is required
    Note over J,D: Home worker can stay online continuously
    Note over F,A: Every family member has an individual identity
    Note over W,J: Current owner-only authorization must be extended with family/device grants
